title: El cerco, pueblo por pueblo
max-visits: 1
view-if: 0
# Container/namespace only. EIGHT TOWNS, EIGHT ENCIRCLEMENTS. Every one of them closes differently,
# because a ring is made out of the ground it is drawn on. Each has one way out that only exists
# here, and knowing it is the difference between a column and a list of names.
# All route into foco_batalla.cer_fin. ch_p1 selects the family; cer_bonus is local knowledge.

